  "title": "ArEEG: Arabic Inner Speech EEG dataset",
  "description": "ArEEG is an open-access electroencephalography dataset comprising inner speech recordings from 12 Arabic-speaking subjects during tasks with visual cues presented in Modern Standard Arabic. This dataset provides a resource for investigating neural correlates of inner speech processing and developing brain-computer interfaces for Arabic language applications.",
